guarantee: On a v* tag run the GitHub Release carries voicen-<version>-symbols.zip
file: .github/workflows/ci.yml
added_by: test-writer
test: bash scripts/ci/release-guard.test.sh
--- old
*-setup.exe
            target/release/bundle/nsis/voicen-${{ env.VOICEN_VERSION }}-symbols.zip
--- new
*-setup.exe
--- end
